"}]," ","— ","Establishes longevity, which is background rather than evidence about meaning."]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-1 font-bold text-red-700","children":["B","."]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"italic text-eng-navy-500","children":"The window display changed with the seasons."}]," ","— ","Shows Ruth's care for the store, not the neighborhood's attachment to it."]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-1 font-bold text-eng-green-700","children":["C","."]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"italic text-eng-navy-500","children":"Several people in the final line had not bought anything at the store in years."}]," ","— ","Correct. Non-customers showing up is evidence of value that is not commercial."]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-1 font-bold text-red-700","children":["D","."]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"italic text-eng-navy-500","children":"Ruth wrote closing prices on masking tape by hand."}]," ","— ","A poignant detail about Ruth, but it says nothing about the neighborhood."]}]]}]]]}]]}]
33:["$","details","inf-p3",{"className":"group rounded-xl border border-eng-navy-200 bg-white","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-start gap-3 rounded-xl p-4 font-medium text-eng-navy-900 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-eng-teal-600","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-0.5 shrink-0 rounded bg-eng-navy-100 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-bold text-eng-navy-700","children":["Q",3]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"flex-1 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed","children":"Which conclusion goes FURTHER than the passage supports?"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 text-eng-navy-400 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180","aria-hidden":"true","children":"▾"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"border-t border-eng-navy-100 p-4","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-3 rounded-lg bg-eng-green-50 p-3 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-900","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-eng-green-700","children":["Correct answer:"," "]}],"C. Ruth was forced out of business by rising rent on Fulton Street."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-800","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-semibold","children":"Why: "}],"Rising rent is a common cause of small-business closures, but this passage never mentions rent. That makes it outside knowledge, not an inference."]}],[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-2 mt-4 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-eng-navy-500","children":"Every choice, explained"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"space-y-2","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-1 font-bold text-red-700","children":["A","."]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"italic text-eng-navy-500","children":"Ruth was closing the store deliberately rather than suddenly."}]," ","— ","Supported. The gradual sequence from March through September shows a planned wind-down."]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-1 font-bold text-red-700","children":["B","."]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"italic text-eng-navy-500","children":"The closing was noticed by people in the neighborhood."}]," ","— ","Supported. The line past the laundromat is direct evidence."]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-1 font-bold text-eng-green-700","children":["C","."]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"italic text-eng-navy-500","children":"Ruth was forced out of business by rising rent on Fulton Street."}]," ","— ","Correct — this is the unsupported one. The passage gives no financial cause at all."]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"text-sm leading-relaxed text-eng-navy-700","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mr-1 font-bold text-red-700","children":["D","."]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"italic text-eng-navy-500","children":"The store's stock was reduced in its final months."}]," ","— ","Supported. Paragraph 2 states that gaps in the shelves did not fill in."]}]]}]]]}]]}]
